## Resolved Decisions

1. Output — final answers shown by default. Full equation system accessible optionally (expandable). In full solution view, clicking a value highlights the corresponding circuit element in a yellow circle. Bidirectional referencing between solution and canvas.

2. Platform — website (HTML/CSS/JS). Desktop only for now. No app, no Electron, no build complexity.

3. Named variable display — press P to toggle all passive value labels on/off. Key shortcut legend is always visible on screen (e.g. R-resistor, S-source etc.) — serves as onboarding and persistent reference. No help menu needed.
